  "_meta": {
    "what": "Names a monster used to be filed under here, kept searchable after it was renamed.",
    "why": "Every rename in scripts/fix-monster-names.mjs replaced a name that our table really carried, and search matches whole words against the current name only. 'Pecopeco' no longer finds Peco Peco; 'Wootan Fighter' no longer finds Utan Fighter. Some of these are typos nobody would type, but the rest are the older or shorter form a long-time player still uses, and dropping them would trade one search miss for another.",
    "rule": "Only a name this table actually held, with the date it was replaced. Not a guess at what someone might call the monster -- that is what data/aliases-th.json records, and it needs a real search behind it.",
    "source": "scripts/fix-monster-names.mjs, rounds of 7 and 8 Sep 2026; scripts/rename-champions.mjs, 7 Oct 2026 (C1-C5 tier names to the champion names the game shows)"
  },
